  "summary": "This experiment tested scvi_n200 as the RNA encoder in a multiprofile RNA-only setup with avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275, outperforming the pca_n2000 baseline (llm_summary_004). The results suggest scvi_n200 may contribute to performance gains in RNA-only multiprofile configurations, though the specific impact of aggregation and other design choices remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative setups."
